  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower Liberian Children with Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help shape the future of Liberia by supporting education for children. After years of war and the Ebola epidemic, the education system needs our help. With only 44% of primary-age students attending school, the future leaders of Liberia are at risk. This project will make a difference by providing scholarships, uniforms, school supplies, school books, nutritious school lunches, school furniture, teacher support, and classrooms to keep kids in school and enhance their education.</narrative>
  </description>
